  "summary": "HOW CAN I SERVE YOU?\n\n  My career goal is to make sure your business succeeds. As one of the most experienced and skilled software engineering in the United States, I can provide you with the skill and integrity your business needs to succeed. My goal is this: I want to serve you and your business with my skills in the best way possible.\nSpecialties: Career contract software engineer specializing in Full Stack Web Development.  Church leader, speaker and author of the website http://www.endtimesapostasy.org. I enjoy the outdoors and my favorite times are: Working on any construction project with my wife Sheryl. Fly fishing\n\nFavorites:\n\n  Music: Classical.  My favorite works -  Erik Satie: Gymnopedies. Gregorio Allegri: Miserere - beautiful and captivating. Psalm 51 sung in Latin.  Enya. An extraordinary musician. Exile and Long, Long Journey are my favorites, but it's her haunting piano solo's, such as Miss Claire Remembers, that leave you breathless. \n\n Movie: The Matrix - freedom from bondage found in the discovery of truth manifested in the  redemptive power of the Son.\n\n Book: The Bible - Inerrant. The single source for all absolute truth. Timeless and holy. \n\nTechnology: Mob, Extreme programming. Chaos, harnessed for the good of mankind, through peer to peer \"look me in the eye and show me what you can do or you're OUT!\" Exercises that are designed to \"hone you or break you!\" Are you a \"Driver\" or a \"Navigator\"? 5 people. One keyboard. One mouse. Anger management....AMPLIFIED \n\n “In life you need either inspiration or desperation.” – Tony Robbins",
